{"5265910":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"EternalCircuitBoard","steam_appid":5265910,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5314380],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connected circuits generate energy every turn<\/h2>A puzzle game where you place colored chips one at a time on a 6×6 board. Arrange chips in the right shape to complete a circuit and generate energy. Completed circuits stay on the board and generate energy every turn. Chips used in one circuit can also be used in the next. Reach the target score before the stage runs out of turns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three kinds of circuits<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Triangle circuits<\/strong> — Place 3 Energy chips in a right angle to generate energy every turn.<br><\/li><li><strong>Sustain circuits<\/strong> — Tiles between two Protect chips are shielded from blockades.<br><\/li><li><strong>Line circuits<\/strong> — Line up 4 Draw chips to gain Wild chips that can stand in for any chip.<\/li><\/ul>A single chip can complete several circuits at once.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encroaching blockades<\/h2>Blockade warnings appear on the board, and tiles left unprotected become unusable. Extend your circuits or shore up your defenses — every placement shapes the board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A tutorial and 60 stages<br><\/li><li>A preview that shows which circuits a placement completes and how much energy it earns, before you commit<br><\/li><li>Stage-specific twists such as bonus colors and challenges<br><\/li><li>Play with mouse or gamepad<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connected circuits generate energy every turn<\/h2>A puzzle game where you place colored chips one at a time on a 6×6 board. Arrange chips in the right shape to complete a circuit and generate energy. Completed circuits stay on the board and generate energy every turn. Chips used in one circuit can also be used in the next. Reach the target score before the stage runs out of turns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three kinds of circuits<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Triangle circuits<\/strong> — Place 3 Energy chips in a right angle to generate energy every turn.<br><\/li><li><strong>Sustain circuits<\/strong> — Tiles between two Protect chips are shielded from blockades.<br><\/li><li><strong>Line circuits<\/strong> — Line up 4 Draw chips to gain Wild chips that can stand in for any chip.<\/li><\/ul>A single chip can complete several circuits at once.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encroaching blockades<\/h2>Blockade warnings appear on the board, and tiles left unprotected become unusable. Extend your circuits or shore up your defenses — every placement shapes the board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A tutorial and 60 stages<br><\/li><li>A preview that shows which circuits a placement completes and how much energy it earns, before you commit<br><\/li><li>Stage-specific twists such as bonus colors and challenges<br><\/li><li>Play with mouse or gamepad<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Place chips on a 6×6 board and build circuits that generate energy. Completed circuits stay on the board, generate energy every turn, and can be reused in the next circuit. Connect circuits within a limited number of turns and reach the target score.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5265910\/6802666dd6042a4f5f19fa4f7510ba144974820f\/header.jpg?t=1793707499","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5265910\/588729aa5794bbcc53c2d80154995536e24447bc\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793707499","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5265910\/588729aa5794bbcc53c2d80154995536e24447bc\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793707499","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 21H1) or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x64 processor with SSE2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible graphics card<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["HS Games"],"publishers":["HS Games"],"demos":[{"appid":5314380,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":424,"discount_percent":15,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$4.24"},"packages":[1821001],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy EternalCircuitBoard","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1821001,"percent_savings_text":"-15% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"EternalCircuitBoard - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $4.24","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":424}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSe